{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1558313-the-old-cybermancer-has-resurfsed","id":1558313,"title":"The old Cybermancer has resurfsed","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-02-14T03:37:53-08:00","id":1558313,"title":"The old Cybermancer has resurfsed","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">during the week I found what could be my original Build Sheet for Clive Coursor from 1993, written on a piece of Tractor Feed computer Paper the paper is yellowed and stained the pencil is faded and my late adolescent dyslexic scrawl is unreadable, but along with him is my first photocopied Character sheet from the back of 1e Mage, a couple of copies of the expanded character sheet photocopied from the back of The VA Tradition book you can see the Retcons made with the release of Source Books and the XP spent till around '96 then updates disappear till '98 when a player copy shows up, at this time the Story Teller held all the &quot;Official&quot; Masters and I have a tatted and unreadable bit of note paper with what I assume are updates from just before the Millennium.<br /> <br /> anybody interested in seeing him? </span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12939-clive-coursor","name":"Clive Coursor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-14T10:23:36-08:00","id":1558319,"title":"","content":"Yes! And it doesn't require qualification.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-14T13:44:45-08:00","id":1558323,"title":"","content":"I'll try to find the best one because some don't agree on Skills as the Storyteller would Retrcon skills in and out as well as Merits &amp; Flaws (normally ones lifted from other parts of the WoD)<br /> <br /> But originally he had a Dynamic Essence but we both agreed that he was really &quot;Questing&quot; then changed it back and forth over the years, he started as a &quot;Paten Mage&quot; but did branch out a bit due to stuff he always wanted and the effects of his Chronicle. He was Dual Natured being a Loaner/Caregiver with a Demeanor of Loaner, his Care Giving took the form more of him giving people the Tools to fix their own Shiz instead of just a hand out or fixing it fore them. originally he was a Shy Loaner Asshole Edge Lord, but he got over himself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12939-clive-coursor","name":"Clive Coursor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-14T14:05:36-08:00","id":1558324,"title":"","content":"this is taken from the Final available sheet, there are variants on some things due to two versions being around at the same time due to Retcons and the potability of Magic Effects I've forgotten being in effect, I'll release by section than a full version when I'm done.<br /> <br /> Str 2, Dex 3, Sta,3<br /> Cha 2, Man 2, App 3 (there is a version with Cha 3 from like '95 that drops back to Cha 2 the same year and a '98 version with the same)<br /> Per 3, Int 5, Wits 4","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12939-clive-coursor","name":"Clive Coursor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-14T15:13:08-08:00","id":1558328,"title":"","content":"What spheres did he focus on?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-14T15:45:06-08:00","id":1558330,"title":"","content":"Initially Forces (3) and Mater (2) wanted Prime 2 but could only afford Prime (1), Chronicle forced me in to Life that got to 3 early, was able to divert XP in to Prime and Correspondence 2, then got Mater 3 as i picked up a bit of Mind then Correspondence 3.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12939-clive-coursor","name":"Clive Coursor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-14T16:07:45-08:00","id":1558332,"title":"","content":"Talaents<br /> Alertness 3, Athletics 2, Awareness 3 (perhaps 4), Brawl 2, Dodge 3, Expression 1, Instruction 3, Intuition 2<br /> Skills<br /> Do 3, Drive 2, Firearms 2, Mediation 3, Melee 2, Research 4, Stealth 2, Survival 1, Technology 5, Psychoanalysis 3, Literature 2, Speed Reading 3<br /> Knowledges<br /> Computer 4, Cosmology 3, Enigmas 4, Investigation 3, Linguistics ?, Medicine 2, Occult 4 (or 5), Science 5, Computer Hacking 5, Psychology 2, Alchemy 3, Astrology 3, Herbology 3, Parapsychology 3, Metaphysics 4, Archeology 3, History 4, Mathematics 4 and a Ton of Lore Skills highlights include, Lore Mage 4, Lore OoH 3, Lore Verbena 2, Lore SoE 3, Lore AB 2, Lore VA 4, Lore Technocracy 3, Lore Int X 3, Lore Werewolf 2, Lore Faerie 2.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12939-clive-coursor","name":"Clive Coursor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-17T21:54:23-08:00","id":1558371,"title":"","content":"Work has bean hectic, hence the delay, but I had to have the day off due to Heatstroke, so the Spheres, the Storyteller was against letting me go to rank 4 in any sphere in the 6-7 years the chronicle was playing (off and on) that accounted for like three years of game time.<br /> <br /> Correspondence 3, Forces 3, Life 3, Mind 2, Matter 3, Prime 2, Time 2.<br /> <br /> I had to pick up Life 3 for a story arc, apart from a few Rituals to resolve a Story I've never relay used Rank 3 effects sticking to just rank 1 &amp; 2 Effects","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12939-clive-coursor","name":"Clive Coursor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-20T02:11:11-08:00","id":1558392,"title":"","content":"Other Stuff<br /> Arete 6<br /> Willpower 7 (was 8 for a wile)<br /> <br /> Backgrounds<br /> Arcane 1, Avatar 4, Mentor 2, Node (Miami) 3, Node (Oakland) 2, Sanctum (Miami) 3, Sanctum (Oakland) 3, Allies 1, Contacts (Many), Resources 2, Library 4 (Multiple Copies of same stuff)<br /> <br /> Merits<br /> Computer Aptitude, Dual Nature, Bisuness<br /> <br /> (Resolved) Flaws<br /> Variable Resources (roll Resources each success earns one level of Dividends for that month, TN Set by Storyteller depending on circumstances)<br /> Werewolf Enemy (now Rival)<br /> Shyness<br /> <br /> (Current) Flaws<br /> Werewolf Rival","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12939,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12939-clive-coursor","user":"Clive Coursor","date":". 02-20-2026, 05:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12939-clive-coursor","name":"Clive Coursor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-21T03:55:58-08:00","id":1558406,"title":"","content":"And the Compiled Sheet<br /> <br /> Name: <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Clive Coursor</span><br /> Nature: Caregiver/Loaner<br /> Demeanor: Loaner<br /> Essence: Dynamic (or Questing)<br /> Tradition: Virtual Adepts<br /> Mentor: Emma Brice<br /> <br /> Attributes<br /> Str 2, Dex 3, Sta,3<br /> Cha 2, Man 2, App 3 (there is a version with Cha 3 from like '95 that drops back to Cha 2 the same year and a '98 version with the same)<br /> Per 3, Int 5, Wits 4<br /> <br /> Abilities<br /> Talaents<br /> Alertness 3, Athletics 2, Awareness 3 (perhaps 4), Brawl 2, Dodge 3, Expression 1, Instruction 3, Intuition 2<br /> Skills<br /> Do 3, Drive 2, Firearms 2, Mediation 3, Melee 2, Research 4, Stealth 2, Survival 1, Technology 5, Psychoanalysis 3, Literature 2, Speed Reading 3<br /> Knowledges<br /> Computer 4, Cosmology 3, Enigmas 4, Investigation 3, Linguistics ?, Medicine